  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心打造。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Name Tag Tweaks 对游戏中的命名牌物品进行了一些改动。拥有自定义名称的生物死亡时将掉落其对应的命名牌。模组新增了一个命令，可在无需铁砧的情况下更改命名牌的名称值。此外，模组还添加了一个合成配方。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum&#x27;s Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>droppedNameTagbyEntityKeepsNameValue</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，生物死亡时掉落的任何命名牌都将保留其名称值。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNameTagCommand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，将添加 /nametag &lt;name&gt; 命令。用于在无需铁砧的情况下更改命名牌名称。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameTagCommandReplaceUnderscoresWithSpaces</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用后，使用 /nametag 命令时将把下划线替换为空格。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>合成配方：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"288\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>/nametag &lt;name&gt; 命令：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"439\" height=\"118\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><strong>以及效果：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"979\" height=\"220\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>在这里你可以看到一只已命名的猪在死亡时掉落其命名牌：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中，你就可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模组。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已关闭，因为我无法在众多独立的模组页面中逐一跟进回复。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他任何事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
